      "text": "\nThe Iberá Wetlands are the main wildlife stop on this trip. They’re home to hundreds of bird species as well as capybaras, caimans and other reptiles. The lodge programme includes photo safaris, motorboat trips and horse riding through the wetlands. After several days in the wild, return to Buenos Aires.\n\n"
